The interaction that produces the rent. The revision gain is crossed with the number of balancing rounds in the noise-only environment of Section [[REF:sec:res-noise]], with sixteen seeds per cell. Neither factor alone moves output: with the balancing step switched off a gain of one leaves output at its no-revision level, and with the gain at zero three rounds of balancing do the same. The loss appears only in the combination and grows in both directions, from 0.9472 at a gain of 0.3 with one round to 0.8711 at a gain of 1.0 with three. The channel is the one-sidedness of the feasibility programme: an optimistic stock estimate is absorbed by the capacity bound, a pessimistic one cuts the plan irrecoverably within the period.
